### 1. Obtener veterinarias cercanas (Módulo 6 - Geolocalización)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/vets
Accept: application/json

### 2. Obtener consejos de cuidado (Módulo 7 - Consejos)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tips
Accept: application/json

### 3. Registrar un nuevo usuario (Módulo 1 - Autenticación)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
x-client-type: mobile

{
  "fullName": "Test Demo",
  "email": "Tests@yolka.app",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "confirmPassword": "Password123!",
  "phone": "+52 55 1234 5678",
  "deviceId": "emulator-5554",
  "deviceToken": "fcm-demo-token"
}

### 4. Iniciar sesión por correo (Módulo 1 - Login)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
x-client-type: mobile

{
  "email": "Test@yolka.app",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "deviceId": "emulator-5554",
  "deviceToken": "fcm-demo-token"
}

### 5. Registrar una mascota (Módulo 2 - Mascotas)
# Reemplaza {{token}} y {{userId}} con los valores devueltos por /login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/pets
Content-Type: application/json
x-client-type: mobile
x-token: {{token}}

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "name": "Max",
  "species": "DOG",
  "breed": "Golden Retriever",
  "color": "Dorado",
  "gender": "MALE",
  "birthDate": "2023-05-14",
  "ageYears": 3,
  "weight": 28.5,
  "size": "LARGE",
  "photoUrl": ""
}
